<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Enrollment Form</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  h1, h2, h3, h4 { font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif; }
  .header-info { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end; margin-bottom: 30px; }
  .logo-area { display: flex; align-items: center; }
  .logo-text { font-size: 24pt; font-weight: bold; }
  .contact-info { text-align: right; font-size: 10pt; }
  .section-title { font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .form-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 15px; font-size: 10pt; }
  .form-group { flex: 1; margin-right: 20px; }
  .form-group.full-width { flex: none; width: 100%; }
  .input-field { border-bottom: 1px solid #000; padding-bottom: 2px; min-width: 150px; }
  .checkbox-group label { margin-right: 15px; font-size: 10pt; }
  .divider { border-top: 1px solid #000; margin: 20px 0; }
  .table-header { font-weight: bold; border-bottom: 1px solid #000; padding-bottom: 3px; }
  .table-row td { padding: 5px 0; font-size: 10pt; }
  .signature-line { border-bottom: 1px solid #000; width: 50%; margin-top: 50px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page">
  <div class="header-info">
    <div class="logo-area">
      <div class="logo-text">Enrollment Form</div>
      <div style="margin-left: 20px;">
        <img src="placeholder_logo.png" alt="Logo" style="height: 50px;">
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="contact-info">
      PO Box {{ po_box_number }}<br>
      {{ city_state_zip_1 }}<br>
      CollegeCounts529.com
    </div>
  </div>

  <p style="font-size: 10pt;">
    • ENROLL ONLINE at <span data-field="enrollment_url">{{ enrollment_url }}</span><br>
    • Complete this Enrollment Form to establish an Account. Please return this completed form, check(s), and any other documents to:
  </p>

  <div class="form-row" style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <div class="form-group">
      <strong>Regular Mail:</strong><br>
      CollegeCounts 529 Fund<br>
      PO Box {{ po_box_number }}<br>
      {{ city_state_zip_1 }}
    </div>
    <div class="form-group">
      <strong>Overnight Mail:</strong><br>
      CollegeCounts 529 Fund<br>
      {{ street_address_2 }}<br>
      {{ city_state_zip_2 }}
    </div>
  </div>

  <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 20px;">
    • For assistance, please call toll-free: (866) <span data-field="phone_number">{{ phone_number }}</span>.
  </p>

  <div class="divider"></div>

  <h3 style="font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px;">IMPORTANT INFORMATION ABOUT PROCEDURES FOR OPENING A NEW ACCOUNT:</h3>
  <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    To help the government fight the funding of terrorism and money laundering activities, federal law requires financial institutions to obtain, verify, and record information that identifies each person who opens an account. What this means for you: When you open an account, we will ask for your name, address, date of birth, and other information that will allow us to identify you. We may also ask to see your driver's license or other identifying documents. If this information is not provided, the Program Manager may be delayed or unable to open your Account and accept your investment.
  </p>

  <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <span style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; margin-right: 10px;">1</span>
    <h4 style="margin: 0;">Account Type (Please check only one and complete the appropriate information)</h4>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 15px;">
    <div class="checkbox-group">
      <label><input type="checkbox"> Individual Account (Complete all sections except Section 5.)</label><br>
      <label><input type="checkbox"> UGMA/UTMA Account (Provide the Custodian's information in Section 2 and the Minor's information in Section 3.)</label><br>
      <label><input type="checkbox"> Trust or Entity Ownership (Complete Section 5 instead of Section 2.)</label>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="divider"></div>

  <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <span style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; margin-right: 10px;">2</span>
    <h4 style="margin: 0;">Account Owner Information</h4>
  </div>

  <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 15px;">
    The Account Owner, who is at least 19 years old, is the person who controls the Account, names the Designated Beneficiary, directs withdrawals, and receives the Account statements.
  </p>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="form-group">
      First Name: <span class="input-field">{{ owner_first_name }}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="form-group">
      M.I.: <span class="input-field">{{ owner_middle_initial }}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="form-group">
      Last Name: <span class="input-field">{{ owner_last_name }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="form-group">
      Social Security Number: <span class="input-field">{{ owner_ssn }}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="form-group">
      Date of Birth: <span class="input-field">{{ owner_dob }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="form-group">
      Gender: <span class="input-field" data-field="date_of_birth">{{ date_of_birth }}</span>
      <div style="margin-top: 5px;">
        <label><input type="radio" name="gender" value="M"> M</label>
        <label><input type="radio" name="gender" value="F"> F</label>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-group">
      Residency Status: <span class="input-field" data-field="f">{{ f }}</span>
      <div style="margin-top: 5px;">
        <label><input type="checkbox"> U.S. Citizen</label>
        <label><input type="checkbox"> U.S. Resident Alien</label>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="form-group full-width">
      Account Mailing Address: <span class="input-field">{{ owner_mailing_address }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="form-group full-width">
      Permanent Address (if different from above; no PO Boxes): <span class="input-field">{{ owner_permanent_address }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="form-group">
      Phone: <span class="input-field">{{ owner_phone }}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="form-group">
      E-Mail Address: <span class="input-field">{{ owner_email }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 30px;">
    Questions? Please call toll-free (866) <span data-field="phone_number">{{ phone_number }}</span>.
  </p>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <span style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; margin-right: 10px;">3</span>
    <h4 style="margin: 0;">Designated Beneficiary Information</h4>
  </div>

  <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 15px;">
    The Designated Beneficiary is the individual whose qualified higher education expenses will be paid from the Account.
  </p>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="form-group">
      First Name: <span class="input-field">{{ beneficiary_first_name }}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="form-group">
      M.I.: <span class="input-field">{{ beneficiary_middle_initial }}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="form-group">
      Last Name: <span class="input-field">{{ beneficiary_last_name }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="form-group">
      Social Security Number: <span class="input-field">{{ beneficiary_ssn }}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="form-group">
      Date of Birth: <span class="input-field">{{ beneficiary_dob }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="form-group full-width">
      <label><input type="checkbox"> Please check this box if the Beneficiary's address is the same as the Account Owner's.</label>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="form-group full-width">
      Permanent Address (no PO Boxes): <span class="input-field">{{ beneficiary_permanent_address }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="form-group">
      City, State, ZIP: <span class="input-field">{{ beneficiary_city_state_zip }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="divider"></div>

  <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <span style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; margin-right: 10px;">4</span>
    <h4 style="margin: 0;">Successor Account Owner (Optional)</h4>
  </div>

  <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 15px;">
    Not permitted for UGMA/UTMA Accounts. The person or entity named below will be the Successor Account Owner in the event of the death of the Account Owner. You may update the Successor Account Owner at any time.
  </p>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="form-group">
      First Name: <span class="input-field">{{ successor_first_name }}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="form-group">
      M.I.: <span class="input-field">{{ successor_middle_initial }}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="form-group">
      Last Name: <span class="input-field">{{ successor_last_name }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="form-group full-width">
      <label><input type="checkbox"> Please check this box if the Successor Account Owner's address is the same as the Account Owner's.</label>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="form-group">
      Mailing Address: <span class="input-field">{{ successor_mailing_address }}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="form-group">
      City, State, ZIP: <span class="input-field">{{ successor_city_state_zip }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="form-group">
      Social Security Number: <span class="input-field">{{ successor_ssn }}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="form-group">
      Date of Birth: <span class="input-field">{{ successor_dob }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="form-group">
      Taxpayer Identification Number (if applicable): <span class="input-field">{{ successor_tin }}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="form-group">
      Date of Trust (if applicable): <span class="input-field">{{ successor_trust_date }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="divider"></div>

  <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <span style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; margin-right: 10px;">5</span>
    <h4 style="margin: 0;">Trust or Other Entity Information</h4>
  </div>

  <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 15px;">
    Complete if you are establishing a Trust or Other Entity as Account Owner.
  </p>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="form-group full-width">
      Name of Trust or Other Entity (Copy of Trust Document Required): <span class="input-field">{{ entity_name }}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="form-group">
      Date of Trust/Date of Entity: <span class="input-field">{{ entity_date }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="form-group full-width">
      Name of Trustee(s) or Authorized Corporate Officer: <span class="input-field">{{ trustee_name }}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="form-group">
      Trust or Entity Tax Identification Number: <span class="input-field">{{ entity_tax_id }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="form-group">
      Trustee Social Security Number: <span class="input-field">{{ trustee_ssn }}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="form-group">
      Trustee Date of Birth: <span class="input-field">{{ trustee_dob }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="form-group full-width">
      Mailing Address: <span class="input-field">{{ entity_mailing_address }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="form-group full-width">
      Permanent Address (if different from above; no PO Boxes): <span class="input-field">{{ entity_permanent_address }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="form-group">
      Phone: <span class="input-field">{{ entity_phone }}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="form-group">
      E-Mail Address: <span class="input-field">{{ entity_email }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 30px;">
    Questions? Please call toll-free (866) <span data-field="phone_number">{{ phone_number }}</span>.
  </p>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <span style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; margin-right: 10px;">6</span>
    <h4 style="margin: 0;">Portfolio Selection</h4>
  </div>

  <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 15px;">
    The Plan offers three different investment approaches. Select from Portfolio options A, B, or C. Your initial and future contribution(s) will be invested based on your following selection. Each investment portfolio is explained in the Program Disclosure Statement and any supplements, which you must read and agree to before completing this form. For more information on the investment portfolios, please visit CollegeCounts529.com or refer to the CollegeCounts 529 Fund Program Disclosure Statement.
  </p>

  <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 10px;">
    CHECK ONLY ONE BOX (A), (B), OR (C).
  </p>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <label style="font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 5px;">A. Age-Based Portfolios — Assets are invested in a mix of stocks, bonds, and money market funds allocated according to the age of the Designated Beneficiary. As the Designated Beneficiary approaches college age, the investment will move to an increasingly conservative allocation. If you've checked box (A), select one of the following:</label>
    <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
      <label><input type="checkbox"> Aggressive Portfolio</label>
      <label><input type="checkbox"> Moderate Portfolio</label>
      <label><input type="checkbox"> Conservative Portfolio</label>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <label style="font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 5px;">B. Target Portfolios — The asset allocations of these portfolios remain fixed or "static" within a specified range. If you've checked box (B), select one of the following:</label>
    <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
      <label><input type="checkbox"> Fund 100</label>
      <label><input type="checkbox"> Fund 80</label>
      <label><input type="checkbox"> Fund 60</label>
      <label><input type="checkbox"> Fund 40</label>
      <label><input type="checkbox"> Fund 20</label>
      <label><input type="checkbox"> Fixed Income Fund</label>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <label style="font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 5px;">C. Individual Fund Portfolios — Create your own investment mix from one or more of the 529 Portfolios below. If you've checked box (C), select one or more of the following (must total 100%).</label>
    <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
      <table style="width: 100%; font-size: 10pt;">
        <tr>
          <td style="width: 50%; padding: 5px 0;">
            <label>Money Market</label><br>
            <label><input type="checkbox"> % Vanguard Prime Money Market</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox"> % Vanguard Large Cap</label>
          </td>
          <td style="width: 50%; padding: 5px 0;">
            <label>Fixed Income</label><br>
            <label><input type="checkbox"> % Vanguard 500 Index 529 Portfolio</label>
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="width: 50%; padding: 5px 0;">
            <label>Fixed Income</label><br>
            <label><input type="checkbox"> % PIMCO Short-Term 529 Portfolio</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox"> % Vanguard Total Stock Market Index 529 Portfolio</label>
          </td>
          <td style="width: 50%; padding: 5px 0;">
            <label>Fixed Income</label><br>
            <label><input type="checkbox"> % Vanguard Growth Index 529 Portfolio</label>
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="width: 50%; padding: 5px 0;">
            <label>Fixed Income</label><br>
            <label><input type="checkbox"> % Vanguard Intermediate-Term Bond Index 529 Portfolio</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox"> % Vanguard Mid-Cap Index 529 Portfolio</label>
          </td>
          <td style="width: 50%; padding: 5px 0;">
            <label>Fixed Income</label><br>
            <label><input type="checkbox"> % Vanguard Total Bond Market Index 529 Portfolio</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox"> % Vanguard Extended Market Index 529 Portfolio</label>
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="width: 50%; padding: 5px 0;">
            <label>Fixed Income</label><br>
            <label><input type="checkbox"> % Fidelity Advisor Investment Grade Bond 529 Portfolio</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox"> % Small-Cap</label>
          </td>
          <td style="width: 50%; padding: 5px 0;">
            <label>Fixed Income</label><br>
            <label><input type="checkbox"> % PIMCO Total Return 529 Portfolio</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox"> % Vanguard Small-Cap Value Index 529 Portfolio</label>
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="width: 50%; padding: 5px 0;">
            <label>Fixed Income</label><br>
            <label><input type="checkbox"> % Vanguard Short-Term Inflation-Protected Securities 529 Portfolio</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox"> % Vanguard Small-Cap Growth Index 529 Portfolio</label>
          </td>
          <td style="width: 50%; padding: 5px 0;">
            <label>Fixed Income</label><br>
            <label><input type="checkbox"> % Vanguard Inflation-Protected Index 529 Portfolio</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox"> % Vanguard Small-Cap Growth Index 529 Portfolio</label>
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="width: 50%; padding: 5px 0;">
            <label>Balanced</label><br>
            <label><input type="checkbox"> % T. Rowe Price Balanced 529 Portfolio</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox"> % Vanguard Total International Stock Index 529 Portfolio</label>
          </td>
          <td style="width: 50%; padding: 5px 0;">
            <label>Real Estate</label><br>
            <label><input type="checkbox"> % Vanguard REIT Index 529 Portfolio</label>
          </td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 20px;">
    Investment Products: Not FDIC Insured, No Bank Guarantee, May Lose Value.
  </p>

  <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 30px;">
    Questions? Please call toll-free (866) <span data-field="phone_number">{{ phone_number }}</span>.
  </p>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <span style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; margin-right: 10px;">7</span>
    <h4 style="margin: 0;">Contribution Information</h4>
  </div>

  <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 15px;">
    Check all that apply. Use this section to select the funding type(s) for your initial investment and/or for subsequent investments. You may select more than one option.
  </p>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <label><input type="checkbox"> A. Enclose a Check made payable to "CollegeCounts 529 Fund" $ <span data-field="initial_contribution_amount">{{ initial_contribution_amount }}</span></label>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <label><input type="checkbox"> B. Deposit of UGMA/UTMA Custodial Assets. I am funding this custodial CollegeCounts 529 Fund Account with assets that were previously held in a custodial account that was established under a Uniform Gift/Transfer to Minors Act (UGMA/UTMA) for the benefit of the Designated Beneficiary indicated in Section 3 of this Enrollment Form. I have read the Program Disclosure Statement and Account Agreement and understand that I will be consolidating assets from a previous custodial account into this CollegeCounts 529 Fund Account. I understand that this means I will not be able to change the Designated Beneficiary on this Account, nor make Nonqualified Withdrawals from this Account, and that I may not change the investment elections on this Account. I understand that these same restrictions will apply to other Contributions made to this Account, regardless of the source of the funds.</label>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <label><input type="checkbox"> C. Transfer/Rollover into the CollegeCounts 529 Fund*</label>
    <p style="font-size: 9pt; margin-top: 5px;">
      You may transfer funds from another 529-qualified tuition program, directly transfer funds from a Coverdell Education Savings Account, or contribute proceeds from a qualified retirement plan. Please review the Program Disclosure Statement and your financial, tax, or legal advisor.
    </p>
    <p style="font-size: 9pt; margin-top: 5px;">
      For more information, consult the CollegeCounts 529 Fund Program Disclosure Statement and your financial, tax, or legal advisor.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <label><input type="checkbox"> Select Rollover from another Qualified 529 Plan*</label>
    <p style="font-size: 9pt; margin-top: 5px;">
      $ <span data-field="rollover_amount">{{ rollover_amount }}</span>
    </p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <label><input type="checkbox"> Funds from a Coverdell Education Savings Account*</label>
    <p style="font-size: 9pt; margin-top: 5px;">
      $ <span data-field="coverdell_amount">{{ coverdell_amount }}</span>
    </p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <label><input type="checkbox"> Funds from a qualified U.S. Savings Bond*</label>
    <p style="font-size: 9pt; margin-top: 5px;">
      $ <span data-field="savings_bond_amount">{{ savings_bond_amount }}</span>
    </p>
  </div>

  <p style="font-size: 9pt; margin-top: 20px;">
    *You are responsible for providing the CollegeCounts 529 Fund with the breakdown between contributions and earnings of the amount of the transfer/rollover. Please provide an account statement from the prior financial institution detailing the contribution portion (basis) and the earnings portion of the contribution. If a breakdown is not provided, we are required by law to treat the entire amount as earnings in computing future withdrawals.
  </p>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <label><input type="checkbox"> D. Payroll Deduction. Complete the Payroll Deduction Form (check with your employer as to availability) and return it with this Enrollment Form.</label>
  </div>

  <div class="divider"></div>

  <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <span style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; margin-right: 10px;">7</span>
    <h4 style="margin: 0;">Contribution Information (Continued)</h4>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <label><input type="checkbox"> E. Automatic Investment Plan - Allows automatic contribution transfers from your bank account into a CollegeCounts 529 Fund Account, as well as automatic deposit of distributions from a CollegeCounts 529 Fund Account.</label>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="form-group">Frequency (check one):</div>
    <div class="form-group">Timing:</div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="form-group">
      <label><input type="checkbox"> Weekly</label>
      <label><input type="checkbox"> Twice a Month</label>
      <label><input type="checkbox"> Monthly</label>
      <label><input type="checkbox"> Quarterly</label>
    </div>
    <div class="form-group">
      Day of the Week (circle one) <span class="input-field" data-field="quarterly">{{ quarterly }}</span> Monday Tuesday Wednesday Thursday Friday
      <br>
      Days of Month: <span class="input-field" data-field="monday_tuesday_wednesday_thursday_friday">{{ monday_tuesday_wednesday_thursday_friday }}</span> &
      <span class="input-field" data-field="days_of_month">{{ days_of_month }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="form-group">Day of Month: <span class="input-field" data-field="days_of_month_2">{{ days_of_month_2 }}</span> (If not provided, the transfers will occur on the 7th & 21st of the month.)</div>
    <div class="form-group">Day of Month: <span class="input-field" data-field="day_of_month">{{ day_of_month }}</span> (If not provided, the transfer will occur on the 17th of the month.)</div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="form-group">Check One:</div>
    <div class="form-group">
      <label><input type="checkbox"> January, April, July, and October</label>
      <label><input type="checkbox"> February, May, August, and November</label>
      <label><input type="checkbox"> March, June, September, and December</label>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="form-group">Annually</div>
    <div class="form-group">Month <span class="input-field" data-field="annually">{{ annually }}</span> and Day of Month (i.e., 1-31) <span class="input-field" data-field="month">{{ month }}</span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="divider"></div>

  <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <p style="font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 10px;">Bank Account Information:</p>
    <div class="form-row">
      <div class="form-group">1. Account Type:</div>
      <div class="form-group">
        <label><input type="radio" name="account_type" value="Checking"> Checking</label>
        <label><input type="radio" name="account_type" value="Savings"> Savings</label>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <p style="font-size: 9pt;">
      &bull; Tape voided check here. Do not staple
    </p>
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 10px;">
      <div style="width: 45%;">
        <p style="font-size: 9pt;">YOUR NAME</p>
        <p style="font-size: 9pt;">PAY TO THE</p>
        <p style="font-size: 9pt;">TAPE YOUR PREPRINTED VOIDED CHECK OR SAVINGS ACCOUNT DEPOSIT SLIP HERE. $ <span data-field="deposit_amount">{{ deposit_amount }}</span> DOLLARS</p>
        <p style="font-size: 9pt;">BANK NAME AND ADDRESS</p>
      </div>
      <div style="width: 45%; text-align: right;">
        <p style="font-size: 9pt;">VOID</p>
        <p style="font-size: 9pt;">123456789</p>
        <p style="font-size: 9pt;">34568</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <p style="font-size: 9pt;">
      I hereby authorize the Program Manager to initiate debit entries to the bank account indicated above, and the bank indicated above to debit the same amount. This authority is to remain in full force and effect until the Program Manager receives notification from me of its modification or termination in such time as required by law. I understand that I am responsible for all debits and credits to my account, and that I may be liable for any errors or omissions in the information provided. I understand that the Program Manager may cancel this service will be canceled by the Program Manager. I acknowledge that the origination of ACI transactions to my account must comply with the Program Disclosure Statement and Account Agreement. I understand that I may be liable for any errors or omissions in the information provided.
    </p>
    <p style="font-size: 9pt; margin-top: 10px;">
      Union Bank & Trust Company may correct any transfer with a debit or credit to my financial institution account and/or my CollegeCounts 529 Fund Account.
    </p>
    <p style="font-size: 9pt; margin-top: 10px;">
      Please allow approximately 10 business days for the first transfer. Please retain a copy of this authorization for your records.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 50px;">
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between;">
      <div style="width: 50%;">
        Signature of Bank Account Owner
      </div>
      <div style="width: 50%;">
        Date
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 30px;">
    Questions? Please call toll-free (866) <span data-field="phone_number">{{ phone_number }}</span>.
  </p>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <span style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; margin-right: 10px;">8</span>
    <h4 style="margin: 0;">Authorization</h4>
  </div>

  <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 15px;">
    The Account Owner must sign and date this section in ink below:
  </p>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">
      I acknowledge that I have received and read the current Program Disclosure Statement, Account Agreement, and all other documents related to this Enrollment Form and agree to be bound by the terms and conditions contained therein.
    </p>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">
      I hereby ratify any telephone instructions given pursuant to this authorization and agree that the Board, Program, and Account Manager may use this information to open and maintain this Account.
    </p>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">
      I understand that telephone calls may be recorded by the Program Manager, and I consent to such recordings.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">
      I certify that I am at least 19 years of age or older. I am a U.S. citizen or a U.S. resident alien.
    </p>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">
      The information I have provided on this form is accurate and true.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">
      I certify that if I am funding this Account from a 529 Plan, I have received and read the Program Disclosure Statement and Account Agreement and I understand that I will be consolidating assets from a previous 529 Plan into this CollegeCounts 529 Fund Account. I understand that this means I will not be able to change the Designated Beneficiary on this Account, nor make Nonqualified Withdrawals from this Account, and that I may not change the investment elections on this Account. I understand that these same restrictions will apply to other Contributions made to this Account, regardless of the source of the funds.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">
      I understand that providing my e-mail address gives the Program Manager permission to send me information about the CollegeCounts 529 Fund and services via email.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">
      CERTIFICATION. Under penalties of perjury, I certify that:
    </p>
    <ol style="font-size: 10pt; margin-left: 20px;">
      <li>The number shown on this form is my correct taxpayer identification number, and</li>
      <li>I am not subject to backup withholding because: (a) I am exempt from backup withholding, or (b) I have not been notified by the Internal Revenue Service (IRS) that I am subject to backup withholding as a result of failure to report all interest or dividends, or (c) the IRS has notified me that I am no longer subject to backup withholding, and</li>
      <li>I am a U.S. citizen or U.S. resident alien, a domestic trust, an estate, a partnership, corporation, or company created or organized in the United States or under the laws of the United States.</li>
    </ol>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">
      If you are a resident of a state other than Alabama, you should check with your home state to see if it offers a Section 529 program. That program may offer state tax or other benefits to residents of that state which may not be available to investors in programs of other states.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 50px;">
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between;">
      <div style="width: 50%;">
        Signature of Account Owner
        <div class="signature-line" data-field="field_1">{{ field_1 }}</div>
        Print Name Here
      </div>
      <div style="width: 50%;">
        Title (if other than an individual establishing the Account)
        <div class="signature-line" data-field="print_name_here">{{ print_name_here }}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 50px; text-align: center;">
    <img src="placeholder_seal.png" alt="Seal" style="height: 60px; margin-bottom: 10px;">
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">
      Offered by the State of Alabama
    </p>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">
      UBT 529 Services a Division of Union Bank & Trust Company. Program Manager
    </p>
  </div>

  <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 30px;">
    Questions? Please call toll-free (866) <span data-field="phone_number">{{ phone_number }}</span>.
  </p>
</div>

</body>
